  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Make an attack against a target within Melee range. On a success, <strong>spend a Fea</strong>r to deal <strong>3d10+2</strong> magic damage and force the target to make a Strength Reaction Roll (18). On a failure, they are <em>Withering</em> until their next rest or they succeed on a Strength roll. A <em>Withering</em> target can't clear HP and must roll a d6 before they make an action roll. On a result of 3 or lower, they must mark a HP.</p>",
